Used to create the SCD type 2 logic in code

SELECT
CASE
        WHEN file_date = MAX(file_date) OVER (PARTITION BY trade_id)
        THEN 'Y'
        ELSE 'N'
    END AS active_flag,

    file_date AS start_date,

    LEAD(file_date) OVER (
        PARTITION BY trade_id
        ORDER BY file_date
    ) AS end_date,
